功，不幸早没，追赠以郡，犹未副之","accounts":[{"id":"rensu-a-3e16c45c1520550edf94","label":"裴注·魏武故事","text":"枣祗兴屯田之功，不幸早没，追赠以郡，犹未副之","evidence":["rensu-q-82360a980898884c8245"]},{"id":"rensu-a-3c7b8625cb72d0fb549f","label":"裴注·魏武故事","text":"令重思之：枣祗宜受封，稽留至今孤之过也；子处中宜加封爵，以祀祗为不朽之事","evidence":["rensu-q-e1aeaf51801e923bd9b1"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0127","role":"早没受追赠者；宜受封者","evidence":["rensu-q-82360a980898884c8245","rensu-q-e1aeaf51801e923bd9b1"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"下令者","evidence":["rensu-q-e1aeaf51801e923bd9b1"]},{"person":"rensu-p0036","role":"宜加封爵者","evidence":["rensu-q-e1aeaf51801e923bd9b1"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-82360a980898884c8245","rensu-q-e1aeaf51801e923bd9b1"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-82360a980898884c8245","source_order":[16,18,335],"order":3390}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0127","name":"枣祗","evidence":["wudi-q-o047","chengguo-q-051652e52eec9071a1d8","rensu-q-eb157a835335512305f2","rensu-q-6bf9d98613d749137f8e","rensu-q-85688ef535701e9ba1ed","rensu-q-1e383e5b762f5fbdf776","rensu-q-904c26b8b709cabf889d","rensu-q-dc1d182c299189b9db4f","rensu-q-8cce79dcc70862fa26e7","rensu-q-a023a92ed4ca3239e318","rensu-q-c7c7db2c71c7099618b5","rensu-q-82360a980898884c8245","rensu-q-e1aeaf51801e923bd9b1","rensu-q2-ae0971a600422cb42bea"],"facts":[{"id":"rensu-f2-5ec573b9439aaa1def0a","text":"《魏武故事》载枣祗子处中；《文士传》记祗本姓棘，先人为避难改枣氏，孙据字道彦为晋冀州刺史，据子嵩为散骑常侍，嵩兄腆为襄阳太守。","evidence":["rensu-q2-ae0971a600422cb42bea"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o047-wudi-p0127","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o047"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-051652e52eec9071a1d8","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-ef6e6d390c285fe0d80e","layer":"original","quote":"昱至东阿，东阿令枣祗已率厉吏民，拒城坚守。又兖州从事薛悌，与昱协谋，卒完三城，以待太祖","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":14,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28