"source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-60f466d9d92c616eb2c9","start":111,"end":147,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-6bf9d98613d749137f8e","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f7bf4f39640b854492a0","layer":"pei","quote":"后袁绍在冀州，亦贪祗，欲得之。祗深附托于孤","attribution":"裴注·魏武故事","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-60f466d9d92c616eb2c9","start":38,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-82360a980898884c8245","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f7bf4f39640b854492a0","layer":"pei","quote":"祗兴其功，不幸早没；追赠以郡，犹未副之","attribution":"裴注·魏武故事","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-60f466d9d92c616eb2c9","start":335,"end":354,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-85688ef535701e9ba1ed","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f7bf4f39640b854492a0","layer":"pei","quote":"使领东阿令","attribution":"裴注·魏武故事","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-60f466d9d92c616eb2c9","start":60,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-8cce79dcc70862fa26e7","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f7bf4f39640b854492a0","layer":"pei","quote":"孤不知所从，使与荀令君议之","attribution":"裴注·魏武故事","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-60f466d9d92c616eb2c9","start":207,"end":220,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-904c26b8b709cabf889d","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f7bf4f39640b854492a0","layer":"pei","quote":"后大军粮乏，得东阿以继，祗之功也","attribution":"裴注·魏武故事","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-60f466d9d92c616eb2c9","start":94,"end":110,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-a023a92ed4ca3239e318","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f7bf4f39640b854492a0","layer":"pei","quote":"祗犹自信，据计画还白，执分田之术","attribution":"裴注·魏武故事","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-60f466d9d92c616eb2c9","start":266,"end":282,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-c7c7db2c71c7099618b5","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f7bf4f39640b854492a0","layer":"pei","quote":"孤乃然之，使为屯田都尉，施设田业。其时，岁则大收，后遂因此大田，丰足军用","attribution":"裴注·魏武故事","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-60f466d9d92c616eb2c9","start":283,"end":319,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-dc1d182c299189b9db4f","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f7bf4f39640b854492a0","layer":"pei","quote":"施行后，祗白以为：‘僦牛输谷，大收不增谷，有水旱灾除，大不便。’反覆来说，孤犹以为当如故，大收，不可复改易","attribution":"裴注·魏武故事","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-60f466d9d92c616eb2c9","start":148,"end":201,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-e1aeaf51801e923bd9b1","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f7bf4f39640b854492a0","layer":"pei","quote":"今重思之，祗宜受封；稽留至今，孤之过也。祗子处中，宜加封爵，以祀祗为不朽之事","attribution":"裴注·魏武故事","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-60f466d9d92c616eb2c9","start":355,"end":393,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-eb157a835335512305f2","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-e04a88325a01db0dc84a","layer":"original","quote":"是时岁饥旱，军食不足；羽林监颍川枣祗，建置屯田","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q2-ae0971a600422cb42bea","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f7bf4f39640b854492a0","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏武故事》载令曰：“故陈留太守枣祗，天性忠能。始共举义兵，周旋征讨。后袁绍在冀州，亦贪祗，欲得之。祗深附托于孤，使领东阿令。吕布之乱，兖州皆叛；惟范、东阿完在：由祗以兵据城之力也。后大军粮乏，得东阿以继，祗之功也。及破黄巾，定许，得贼资业，当兴立屯田。时议者皆言当‘计牛输谷’，佃科以定。施行后，祗白以为：‘僦牛输谷，大收不增谷，有水旱灾除，大不便。’反覆来说，孤犹以为当如故，大收，不可复改易。祗犹执之；孤不知所从，使与荀令君议之。时故军祭酒侯声云：‘科取官牛，为官田计，如祗议：于官便，于客不便。’声怀此云云，以疑令君；祗犹自信，据计画还白，执分田之术。孤乃然之，使为屯田都尉，施设田业。其时，岁则大收，后遂因此大田，丰足军用；摧灭群逆，克定天下，以隆王室。祗兴其功，不幸早没；追赠以郡，犹未副之。今重思之，祗宜受封；稽留至今，孤之过也。祗子处中，宜加封爵，以祀祗为不朽之事。”《文士传》曰：“祗本姓棘，先人避难，易为枣。孙据，字道彦，晋冀州刺史；据子嵩，字台产，散骑常侍：并有才名，多所著述。嵩兄腆，字玄方，襄阳太守，亦有文采。”","attribution":"裴注·魏武故事","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-60f466d9d92c616eb2c9","start":0,"end":472,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o030a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1e20b10a33611639b713","layer":"original","quote":"会张邈与陈宫叛迎吕布〖1〗，郡县皆应；荀彧、程昱保鄄城，范、东阿二县固守〖2〗。太祖乃引军还。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":217,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o033a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-7db72ecc60975296f7a1","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，太祖至东阿。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":233,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":10,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o047a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-bbb49ee5ce4b090e1111","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，用枣祗、韩浩等议〖5〗，始兴屯田〖6〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":284,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗建安元年：公元 196 年。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":264,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-df2756e12f4ac1fef3c4","start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：兴平二年（公元 195）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8c38464987eb86819ded","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o028","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fefe0240b8480efce927","layer":"original","quote":"兴平元年春，太祖自徐州还〖1〗。初，太祖父嵩，去官后还谯。董卓之乱，避难琅邪〖2〗。为陶谦所害，故太祖志在复仇东伐。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":204,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o040","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c71d10ef121af30ac6b7","layer":"original","quote":"建安元年春正月〖1〗，太祖军临武平〖2〗。袁术所置陈相袁嗣，降。太祖将迎天子，诸将或疑；荀彧、程昱劝之。乃遣曹洪将兵西迎。卫将军董承与袁术将苌奴拒险〖3〗，洪不得进。汝南、颍川黄巾何仪、刘辟、黄邵、何曼等〖4〗，众各数万。初应袁术，又附孙坚〖5〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":124,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o047","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-bbb49ee5ce4b090e1111","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，用枣祗、韩浩等议〖5〗，始兴屯田〖6〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":284,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-5f59791b711af6d8f180","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-65d1896f1f9ded3e140d","layer":"original","quote":"太祖欲广置屯田，使渊典其事。渊屡陈损益，相土处民〖5〗，计民置吏；明功课之法〖6〗。五年中，仓廪丰实，百姓竞劝乐业","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":134,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":57,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-eb7264c567ccb419c713","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-12e51a7896aa63a3c457","layer":"original","quote":"涣白太祖曰：“夫民安土重迁，不可卒变；易以顺行，难以逆动；宜顺其意，乐之者乃取，不欲者勿强。”太祖从之，百姓大悦","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":22,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":35,"end":91,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
